<title>USA: Cali Realty Corp merges with Robert Martin.</title>
<headline>Cali Realty Corp merges with Robert Martin.</headline>
<dateline>CRANFORD, N.J. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cali Realty Corp said Friday it completed the previously announced $440 million merger with Robert Martin Company LLC.</p>
<p>Commenting on the transaction, Thomas A. Rizk, president and chief executive of Cali, said, &quot;This merger furthers Cali's strategic goal of expanding our presence in the northeast region and becoming a super-regional REIT.&quot;</p>
<p>Cali Realty Corp provides leasing, management, acquisition, development, construction, and tenant-related services for its portfolio.</p>
</text>
